{
  "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
  "sourceName": "Saheeh International",
  "language": "en",
  "direction": "ltr",
  "surahNumber": 100,
  "entries": [
    {
      "verseKey": "100:1",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 1,
      "text": "By the racers, panting,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:2",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 2,
      "text": "And the producers of sparks [when] striking",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:3",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 3,
      "text": "And the chargers at dawn,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:4",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 4,
      "text": "Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:5",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 5,
      "text": "Arriving thereby in the center collectively,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:6",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 6,
      "text": "Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:7",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 7,
      "text": "And indeed, he is to that a witness.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:8",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 8,
      "text": "And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:9",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 9,
      "text": "But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:10",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 10,
      "text": "And that within the breasts is obtained,",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    },
    {
      "verseKey": "100:11",
      "surahNumber": 100,
      "ayahNumber": 11,
      "text": "Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Aware.",
      "sourceId": "qf-20-saheeh-international",
      "sourceName": "Saheeh International"
    }
  ]
}
